        Consider a standard ₹10,00,000 personal or vehicle loan taken for 5 years at an 8.5% annual interest rate with monthly payments:
      </p>
      <div class="my-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900 text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-1.5 font-mono">
        <div>Loan Amount: <strong>₹10,00,000</strong></div>
        <div>Interest Rate: <strong>8.5% per annum</strong></div>
        <div>Loan Term: <strong>5 Years (60 Months)</strong> | Payment Frequency: <strong>Monthly</strong></div>
        <div class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">Estimated Monthly Payment (EMI): ₹20,517 / month</div>
